Mask: CI-Reader (Tasked Spirit), read-only. Handback to final.md in your seat dir.
Attachments (absolute paths): /home/joshu/.lares-scratch/lease-end/seats/ci-triage/witness-rest.log and /home/joshu/.lares-scratch/lease-end/seats/ci-triage/e2e-shard3.log. Lane worktree at the head: /home/joshu/.lares-scratch/lease-end/wt; the lane's diff from the span: `git -C /home/joshu/.lares-scratch/lease-end/wt diff --stat 5c3d032dc 3b9cac44d` (mesh device-delegation epoch-free edge; keyhive face grant verifier, join writer, seat and daemon founder-standing wiring; recut tests). The span's own CI read green at e723dda17.
Job: for each failing witness and e2e test, name it and its first assertion or error line, quoted from the log. For each: (a) does the lane's diff cause it (name the file and line), or (b) does it read as a flake or load-red unrelated to the lane (evidence)? A witness failure may be a witness that reads a changed file (a census, an inventory, an evergreen or naming witness): say which and what it wants. Read sources in the worktree. Close with: CAUSED / FLAKE / MIXED, and for CAUSED the smallest cure.

